[[Warrior Shing Jea armor]] is an art type available in the Factions campaign, as starter armor (named '''Recruit's armor'''), [[collector]] armor for the region of [[Shing Jea Island]], and as regular craftable armor.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Shing Jea armor.

